Package: artbenchmark
Title: Native Artwork Measurements and Fixed Reference Profiles
Version: 0.11.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Bobby",
           family = "Fatemi",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "bfatemi07@gmail.com")
Description: Computes fifteen artwork descriptors from native source facts,
    color-managed images and retained recording samples. Scores complete
    measurements against a fixed, versioned reference using shared descriptive
    profiles for Time and Activity, Palette and Process, and Structure and Change.
    Computation is independent of database access and artist portfolio size.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/artalytics/artbenchmark
BugReports: https://github.com/artalytics/artbenchmark/issues
SystemRequirements:
  ImageMagick++ (libmagick++-dev),
  ImageMagick magick command-line tool, Q8 non-HDRI with Little CMS and PNG support,
  FFmpeg and ffprobe command-line tools with MOV/MP4 and zscale support
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown, artalytics/templ.pkgdown
